. GAS MARKER SIGN\n- T. APPARENT GAS TEST STATION\n\n## Block 12: table — A table listing trees found on the property, providing an ID number, size (caliper in inches), and type (species) for each tree.\n\nTREE TABLE\n| NO # | SIZ. | TYPE |\n|---|---|---|\n| 4000 | 28\" | LIVE OAK |\n| 4001 | 15\" | HACKBERRY |\n| 4002 | 14\" | LIVE OAK |\n| 4003 | 12\" | LIVE OAK |\n| 4004 | 22\" | LIVE OAK |\n| 4006 | 13\" | LIVE OAK |\n| 4007 | 11\" | HACKBERRY |\n| 4008 | 13\" | HACKBERRY |\n| 4009 | 8\" | HACKBERRY |\n| 4010 | 18\" | CHINA BERRY |\n| 4011 | 9\" | HACKBERRY |\n| 4012 | 12\" | HACKBERRY |\n| 4013 | 11\" | HACKBERRY |\n| 4014 | 9\" | HACKBERRY |\n| 4015 | 8\" | HACKBERRY |\n| 4016 | 10\" | LIVE OAK |\n| 4017 | 10\" | LIVE OAK |\n| 4019 | 10\" | LIVE OAK |\n| 4022 | 24\" | PECAN |\n| 4023 | 24\" | M |\n| 4024 | 8\" | ELM |\n| 4025 | 28\" | LIVE OAK |\n| 4026 | 28\" | HACKBERRY |\n| 4027 | 15\" | M |\n| 4028 | 36\" | HACKBERRY |\n| 4030 | 14\" | PECAN |\n| 4031 | 16\" | LIVE OAK |\n| 4032 | 18\" | LIVE OAK |\n| 4033 | 11\" | ELM |\n| 4034 | 20\" | CHINA BERRY |\n| 4035 | 16\" | ELM |\n| 4036 | 14\" | PECAN |\n| 4037 | 11\" | ASH |\n| 4038 | 20\" | HACKBERRY |\n| 4040 | 11\" | HACKBERRY |\n| 4041 | 13\" | ELM |\n| 4042 | 34\" | LIVE OAK |\n| 4043 | 15\" | LIVE OAK |\n| 4044 | 14\" | LIVE OAK |\n| 4045 | 20\" | LIVE OAK |\n| 4046 | 17\" | LIVE OAK |\n| 4047 | 16\" | PINE |\n\n","numLines":133,"startLine":1,"totalLines":133}}}
