{"level":30,"time":1776445240373,"pid":76090,"hostname":"Williams-MBP.lan","step":"review-runs","item":"2.md","index":7,"runIndex":"run-3","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01L6Jr2FzuC3nNbd1tV8T1Ca","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, now I know what the key sheets contain:\n\n**Sheet 21 (Electrical Design Plan):**\n- Shows underground electric lines, transformer pads, pull boxes\n- Scale 1\" = 20'\n- Has Block 7 which mentions \"Tree List & Geologist Mitigation Rule\" with cross-reference to landscape sheet 32\n\n**Sheet 31 (Landscape Plan):**\n- Shows landscape design, plantings, site contours\n- Scale 1\" = 20'\n- Shows utility lines including \"Overhead Electric\" (per Block 2 description)\n- Shows trees and landscape elements\n\n**Sheet 35 (Landscape Calculations):**\n- Plant schedules with tree species, quantities, and specifications\n- Plant list includes: 10 Cedar Elm (100 gal), 2 Live Oak (100 gal), 6 Mexican Redbud (45 gal), 2 Texas Mountain Laurel (45 gal), and groundcovers\n\nI need to now examine the blocks.md files to see more specific details about:\n1. What electrical infrastructure is shown\n2. Where trees are located relative to that infrastructure\n3. Plant species identification and maturity heights\n4. Whether clearances are dimensioned or noted\n\nLet me read the blocks.md for Sheet 21 first.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4804,"cache_read_input_tokens":35969,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4804},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"848e4c7a-0ebd-4c8c-8f6e-1da50c4b3f33","uuid":"6779e8e1-a964-4d96-a001-293e565174d9"}
