{"level":30,"time":1776445244711,"pid":76090,"hostname":"Williams-MBP.lan","step":"review-runs","item":"1.md","index":3,"runIndex":"run-1","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01FSEkuPZbaBUXwezCbwuW3Y","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good! Now I have the guide.md files for the key sheets. Let me understand what's available:\n\n**Sheet 1 (Cover)**: Contains general project info, but not specific to electrical clearances.\n\n**Sheet 9 (Site Plan)**: Shows the general layout with buildings 1-8, driveways, parking, and retaining walls. Shows 1\" = 20' scale. The cover mentions utilities but I need to see the actual electrical details.\n\n**Sheet 21 (Preliminary Electrical Design Plan)**: This is the critical sheet! It shows:\n- Scale: 1\" = 20'\n- Main Electrical Site Plan (Block 3) showing routing of underground electric lines, transformer pads, pull boxes, and meters\n- Building locations and FFEs (Finished Floor Elevations)\n\nNow I need to read the blocks.md files for these sheets to get the detailed evidence about overhead electric facilities and clearances. However, I notice Sheet 21 mentions \"underground electric lines\" - but the grouping is about OVERHEAD electric lines. Let me check if the plans show any overhead facilities.\n\nThe fact that Sheet 21 is titled \"Preliminary Electrical Design Plan\" and mentions transformers and meters might suggest either:\n1. The electrical design is completely underground (no overhead)\n2. There are both overhead and underground facilities\n\nLet me read the blocks.md file for Sheet 21 and Sheet 9 to see if they show overhead facilities or just underground.\n\nActually, looking back at the facts.md, it mentions:\n- \"5' Electric Easements (×2)\" - plat-dedicated\n- These are likely for overhead lines on the property or adjacent ROW\n\nLet me read the detailed blocks for Sheet 21 and Sheet 9, and also check the cover sheet notes to see if there are any references to overhead utilities.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4769,"cache_read_input_tokens":40505,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4769},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2d610813-7074-4147-a1dd-09845ecb3b90","uuid":"d26e2393-316a-405a-86ce-9ad20f1f570e"}
