{"level":30,"time":1776445417324,"pid":76090,"hostname":"Williams-MBP.lan","step":"review-runs","item":"13.md","index":5,"runIndex":"run-2","documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNum":9,"prompt":"Examine the Site Plan (Sheet 9) and locate all transformer pad symbols. For each transformer pad, identify:\n\n1. Any dimension lines or measurements shown (in feet) indicating clearances from the transformer pad to:\n   - Nearest building\n   - Any fences or barriers\n   - Parking areas\n   - Sidewalks or pathways\n   - Trees or vegetation\n   - Fire hydrants\n   - Other utility equipment\n\n2. Any notes or callouts near the transformer pad locations mentioning:\n   - Required setbacks or clearances\n   - Access requirements\n   - Easement conflicts or restrictions\n   - Service type (single-phase vs. three-phase)\n\n3. The exact position of each transformer pad relative to building units (which units are served, if indicated)\n\n4. Any legends or symbols that define the transformer pad symbol or explain required clearances\n\nDescribe specific measurements if shown (e.g., \"10 feet to Building 2\", \"5 feet from sidewalk\") and note areas where measurements are missing.","res":{"steps":[{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on a detailed visual analysis of the provided Site Plan (Sheet 9), here are the findings regarding the transformer pad(s):\n\n**General Location:**\nThere is only one explicitly labeled transformer pad on this sheet. It is located on the western edge of the site, south of the main entrance driveway, between the front property line/sidewalk and Building 8.\n\n**1. Dimension lines or measurements (Clearances):**\nThere are **no** dimension lines or measurements (in feet or otherwise) indicating clearances from the transformer pad to any surrounding elements. Specifically, there are missing measurements for clearances to:\n*   Nearest building (Building 8)\n*   Any fences or barriers\n*   Parking areas\n*   Sidewalks or pathways\n*   Trees or vegetation\n*   Fire hydrants\n*   Other utility equipment\n\n**2. Notes or callouts near the transformer pad:**\n*   The pad is identified by a leader line with the exact text: **\"Transformer Pad (Typ.)\"**.\n*   There are **no** notes mentioning required setbacks, clearances, access requirements, easement conflicts/restrictions, or service type (single-phase vs. three-phase) for this pad.\n*   Immediately adjacent to the transformer pad callout, there is another leader line pointing to a nearby tree/planter area with the text: **\"Tree Well / (need to look up approp. detail)\"**.\n*   The pad appears to be located near or within a designated public utility easement (a dashed line running parallel to the street), but no specific note addresses a conflict.\n\n**3. Position relative to building units:**\n*   The transformer pad is located to the west of **Building 8**.\n*   The closest specific unit to the pad is **\"Unit 801\"**, which is the westernmost unit of Building 8.\n*   There is no text or diagram indicating exactly which units or buildings this specific transformer serves. \n\n**4. Legends or symbols:**\n*   There is **no** symbol legend or key on this sheet that defines the transformer pad symbol (which is depicted as a small hatched square) or explains any required clearances associated with it. The pad is solely identified by the direct text callout.","providerMetadata":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}],"finishReason":"stop","usage":{"inputTokens":1523,"outputTokens":471,"totalTokens":4576,"reasoningTokens":2582},"warnings":[],"request":{"body":{"prompt":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"file","mediaType":"image/jpeg","data":"[BINARY_DATA_REMOVED - length: 2702484]"},{"type":"text","text":"# Your task\n\nYou are analyzing a subset of a real estate development site plan submission document.\n\nVisually analyze the binary file provided with extreme accuracy. Pay close attention to tables, reproducing them EXACTLY as they appear, character-