{"level":30,"time":1776445578294,"pid":76090,"hostname":"Williams-MBP.lan","step":"review-runs","item":"2.md","index":4,"runIndex":"run-2","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01FhoSbU9WnoczDDDTeb1Af8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Summary of Findings\n\nI completed the comprehensive site plan review for **Grouping EL-2: Tree Clearances from Overhead Electric Lines**. Here are the key findings:\n\n### Items Requiring Corrections (7 items):\n\n**FAIL (1):**\n- **EL-2.11**: Large trees (40+ feet mature height) not identified on plans. The plant schedule lists Cedar Elm and Live Oak with only minimum planting heights (16' minimum), not their mature heights. These species typically reach 40+ feet at maturity but are not differentiated on the landscape plan.\n\n**NOT-VERIFIABLE (6):**\n- **EL-2.1, EL-2.3**: Proposed trees near the overhead electric line on the southern boundary lack clearance dimensions and documented utility compatibility status\n- **EL-2.6**: Utility pole locations not shown on landscape plan\n- **EL-2.7, EL-2.8**: Pad-mounted and underground electric equipment are shown on the electrical design plan but not depicted on the landscape plan in relation to trees\n- **EL-2.9**: Cannot verify root barrier specifications for trees near underground equipment\n- **EL-2.15**: Cannot determine if trees are within prohibited clearance zones without dimension lines\n\n### Items Passing Review (8 items):\n- **EL-2.2, EL-2.4, EL-2.5**: Not applicable (no transmission lines or transmission easements)\n- **EL-2.10**: Species ARE identified in plant schedule (Cedar Elm, Live Oak, Mexican Redbud, Texas Mountain Laurel)\n- **EL-2.12, EL-2.13**: Pass (no clearance dimensions shown, so measurement method issues cannot occur)\n- **EL-2.14**: Trees and overhead electric line both shown on landscape plan\n\n### Primary Issues:\n1. **Missing Mature Heights**: Plant schedule must document the mature height of all proposed trees, especially Cedar Elm and Live Oak\n2. **Missing Clearance Documentation**: No dimension lines showing distances from trees to overhead electric line\n3. **Missing Equipment Cross-Reference**: Electrical equipment (transformers, pull boxes, underground gear) must be shown on landscape plan or clearly cross-referenced with clearance distances"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8299,"cache_read_input_tokens":72028,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8299},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"60b9cdbc-bfc6-4085-b89d-09c184480485","uuid":"adbea084-ae10-4330-9778-f6cf7ef01d75"}
