 boundary on this specific sheet. Various other utility and boundary lines are marked (e.g., \"---LOC---\", \"---SD---\"), but OHE is not indicated here.\n\n**5. Trees proposed on the eastern boundary near overhead lines:**\n*   **Trees Proposed:** Yes. There is a row of proposed trees running along the eastern boundary, generally labeled with \"**M**\". \n*   **Near Overhead Lines:** Similar to the western boundary, there are **no overhead electric lines explicitly labeled** along the eastern boundary on this sheet. The lines shown are limits of construction (\"---LOC---\") and a wooden privacy fence (\"---x---\").\n\n**6. Tree species visible or notated on the plan:**\nSpecific botanical or common tree species are **not visible or notated** on this specific plan sheet. The trees are only identified by their functional classifications (SY, PL, P, M) as detailed in the Key Notes. There is no plant schedule or legend providing species names on this page.","providerMetadata":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}],"finishReason":"stop","usage":{"inputTokens":1528,"outputTokens":675,"totalTokens":4920,"reasoningTokens":2717},"warnings":[],"providerMetadata":{"google":{"promptFeedback":null,"groundingMetadata":null,"urlContextMetadata":null,"safetyRatings":null,"serviceTier":null},"gateway":{"routing":{"originalModelId":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","resolvedProvider":"vertex","resolvedProviderApiModelId":"gemini-3.1-pro-preview","fallbacksAvailable":["google"],"planningReasoning":"System credentials planned for: vertex, google. Total execution order: vertex(system) → google(system)","canonicalSlug":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","finalProvider":"vertex","modelAttemptCount":1,"modelAttempts":[{"modelId":"vertex:gemini-3.1-pro-preview","canonicalSlug":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","success":true,"providerAttemptCount":1,"providerAttempts":[{"provider":"vertex","internalModelId":"vertex:gemini-3.1-pro-preview","providerApiModelId":"gemini-3.1-pro-preview","credentialTyp