es planted under/near overhead lines on southern boundary (per landscape plan vision) - CONFIRMED\n5. NO tree species specified in landscape plan - cannot verify if utility-compatible - FAIL for EL-1.37\n\n\n6. The 48-hour notification requirement for work near high-voltage lines is absent from the release notes. Building elevations with surveyed conductor heights are missing, as are profile/section views showing clearance dimensions. While structures appear adequately setback from the overhead lines, no clearance measurements are documented to verify compliance.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1649,"cache_read_input_tokens":64404,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1649},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6f309802-c1eb-4364-b84a-07fe4c2517f2","uuid":"ccc77563-389c-49c3-9181-f1d51a7a77e3"}
