"sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"No cross-section drawings provided demonstrating vertical clearances from transformer locations to overhead structures, parking garages, or enclosed areas. Vertical clearance compliance cannot be demonstrated."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.32","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4 footnote 1"],"applicableAreas":["All transformer pad locations"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":11}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Transformer type (oil-filled vs. dry-type) not specified. Grading plan not provided showing surface drainage direction around pads. Cannot verify liquid flow directed away from buildings."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.33","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4 footnote 4"],"applicableAreas":["All four transformer pad locations"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":2}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Critical undepicted easements documented in facts.md (Greenbelt Access & Use Easement 0.31 ac, City of Austin Drainage Easement 0.130 ac, and multiple utility easements) prevent verification of private property placement. Cannot confirm transformers are 100% on private property."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.34","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4 footnote 4"],"applicableAreas":["All four transformer pad locations"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":2}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Multiple undepicted easements documented in facts.md. Transformer pad locations not verified against easement areas. Cannot confirm transformers are not in prohibited easements without AE Design approval."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.35","status":"fail","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["All four transformer pad locations"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":2}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Transformer easements not shown around any of the four transformer pads on site plan or plat. No easement widths or boundaries indicated for Austin Energy accessibility and maintenance requirements."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.36","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4 footnote 4"],"applicableAreas":["All four transformer pad locations"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Electrical routing from transformers to meters shown but dimensions and property boundaries not clearly indicated. Cannot verify 100% private property placement of service line from transformer to meter."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.37","status":"fail","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.5.2.6","UCM § 1.18.0"],"applicableAreas":["All four transformer pad locations"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Transformer pad dimensions not shown on electrical plan. No Austin Energy Design-approved transformer pad detail sheets provided for specified service type. Pad dimensions cannot be verified against AE Design specifications."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.38","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4"],"applicableAreas":["Transformer 1 northwest area adjacent to driveway; Transformer 3 southwest area near vehicle route"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Transformers 1 and 3 appear adjacent to vehicle circulation routes, but clearance dimensions from pad to parking/vehicle areas not provided. No bollard details per AE Design standards included."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.39","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["All transformer pad locations"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"No cross-section drawings showing whether customer facilities are installed over Austin Energy overhead distribution. Vertical clearance verification not possible."}]},"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"6d260611-0b71-425b-8987-43b4da8f4c20"}
