Trees Proposed:**\n- YES - Landscape plan (Sheet 31) shows multiple trees\n- Some trees are within 10 feet of the OHE line\n- Trees near utilities not clearly identified by species on the landscape plan\n- Proposed species from plant list (Sheet 35):\n  - Cedar Elm (10) and Live Oak (2) are both incompatible with utility lines\n  - Mexican Redbud (6) and Texas Mountain Laurel (2) are compatible options\n\n**Building Elevations/Profiles:**\n- No elevation sheets with surveyed overhead conductor heights are evident\n- Vertical clearances between buildings and overhead lines are not shown in section views\n\n**Clearance Dimensions:**\n- Main site plan lacks clear dimensioning of clearances\n- No surveyed mid-span clearance data is visible\n\n**48-Hour Notification Note:**\n- Still need to verify this requirement on the cover sheet\n\n**Clearance from Outdoor Site Features:**\n- Driveways, parking areas, and sidewalks require clearance verification\n- Retaining walls are indicated on the plan, and I need to systematically check each remaining checklist item","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1086,"cache_read_input_tokens":59689,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1086},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"97c9d1ef-3ef8-4a72-b129-cbdede465e25","uuid":"75a17dc6-4ab0-4117-b755-9af2399d18c5"}
