rientation:** **Indeterminate**. There are no dashed clearance boxes, access circles, or door indicators to show which way the equipment faces.\n*   **Easement Information:** The pad sits near the edge of the roadway. While there is a \"Wastewater Easement Doc#\" noted further west, no specific utility or vault easement is drawn directly over or pointing to this transformer pad.\n\n### 2. Transformer Pad 2 (Middle-Left, between Bldg 2 & Bldg 8)\n*   **Location:** Located on the western side of the central courtyard area, just south of Bldg 2 and north of Bldg 8.\n*   **Specific Distance Measurements:** **ABSENT**. There are no dimensions provided from the pad to the adjacent buildings, sidewalks, or the adjacent pull box.\n*   **Descriptive Notes:** The area has leader lines labeling \"Electrical Transformer Pad\" and an adjacent \"Electrical Pull Box\". Just south of it, there is a label for \"Underground Electric Line\". No clearance or specification notes are present.\n*   **Dimensions of the Pad:** **ABSENT**.\n*   **Access Orientation:** **Indeterminate**. No clearance zones or directional indicators are drawn.\n*   **Easement Information:** This pad is not located within any distinctly marked dashed easement lines on this sheet.\n\n### 3. Transformer Pad 3 (Bottom-Left, south of Bldg 8)\n*   **Location:** Located at the southwest corner of the site's inner loop, directly south of Bldg 8.\n*   **Specific Distance Measurements:** **ABSENT**. There are no dimensions provided to the building, the adjacent sidewalk, or the immediately adjacent pull box.\n*   **Descriptive Notes:** Labeled with \"Electrical Transformer Pad\" and \"Electrical Pull Box\". Notably, there is also a leader line reading \"**Vault Easement**\" that points directly to the square representing this transformer pad. \n*   **Dimensions of the Pad:** **ABSENT**.\n*   **Access Orientation:** **Indeterminate**. No dashed clearance boxes or access zones are shown.\n*   **Easement Information:** As noted above, a specifically called out \"**Vault Easement**\" is associated directly with this pad location. It is also located immediately adjacent to a dashed line labeled \"**Sidewalk Easement Doc#**\".\n\n### 4. Transformer Pad 4 (Middle-Right, north of Bldg 6)\n*   **Location:** Located on the eastern side of the property, tucked between the eastern boundary line and the area north of Bldg 6 (near unit 604) and east of Bldg 4.\n*   **Specific Distance Measurements:** **ABSENT**. There are no dimensions detailing the distance to Bldg 6, Bldg 4, the eastern property boundary, or the adjacent pull box.\n*   **Descriptive Notes:** Labeled strictly as \"Electrical Transformer Pad\" alongside an \"Electrical Pull Box\". There are no associated clearance rules or detail references.\n*   **Dimensions of the Pad:** **ABSENT**.\n*   **Access Orientation:** **Indeterminate**. No access circles or dashed clearance lines are visible.\n*   **Easement Information:** While it is near the eastern property line (which has adjacent off-site 25' Drainage Easements noted), there is no specific P.U.E. or vault easement drawn directly around or pointing to this specific pad on the subject property. \n\n***\n\n**Summary for the Final Review Agent:**\nIf validation requires exact distances (e.g., verifying a minimum 10-foot clearance from a building), pad dimensions, or clearance zones, **that information is not contained on this preliminary electrical routing sheet**. You will need to locate a dedicated \"Site Utility Plan,\" a \"Dimension Control Plan,\" or specific \"Electrical Details\" sheets to find precise measurements and clearance setbacks.","providerMetadata":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}],"finishReason":"stop","usage":{"inputTokens":1624,"outputTokens":1076,"totalTokens":4805,"reasoningTokens":2105},"warnings":[],"providerMetadata":{"google":{"promptFeedback":null,"groundingMetadata":null,"urlContextMetadata":null,"safetyRatings":null,"serviceTier":null},"gateway":{"ro