{"level":30,"time":1776446612764,"pid":76090,"hostname":"Williams-MBP.lan","step":"review-runs","item":"1.md","index":9,"runIndex":"run-3","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01CHHQK7t6z9HATRUMhyP6gu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01LsPQseesvJtCFRgE8r77BX","name":"StructuredOutput","input":{"grouping":"1","findings":[{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.1","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["Buildings (8 structures) near overhead electric utilities on property boundaries"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":4},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Overhead electric utilities are confirmed on property boundaries (Sheet 4). However, buildings proposed on site plan (Sheet 9) do not include surveyed elevations of overhead conductors or dimensions showing 7.5-foot sky-to-ground clearances from conductor to building faces. Building elevation sheets with conductor elevations and clearance dimensions are not provided."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.3","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["Buildings with potential overhangs, awnings, balconies, or rooflines near overhead utilities"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":4},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Building projections are not detailed with respect to overhead utilities. No section views or building elevations showing surveyed overhead conductor positions and clearance dimensions from building projections (overhangs, awnings, balconies) to conductors are provided. Both 7.5-foot sky-to-ground and 15-foot radial clearances cannot be verified."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.7","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["All 8 proposed buildings on site"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Building elevation sheets with surveyed elevations and locations of overhead electric conductors are not included in the site plan set. Registered surveyor data for overhead conductor elevations are required to demonstrate clearance compliance per UCM § 1.10.3."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.8","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["All proposed buildings and building projections"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Section views and plan view exhibits with dimension lines from outer electric conductors to building edges and projections are not provided. No clearance verification exhibits showing the 7.5-foot and 15-foot clearance envelopes relative to building faces are present on the plans."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.18","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.6.2"],"applicableAreas":["Internal driveways and site circulation areas"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":4},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":11}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Driveways and parking areas on site plan do not display verified vertical clearance dimensions to overhead electric lines. No survey data showing mid-span clearances from overhead conductors to finished driveway/parking grades are provided. Cannot verify 16-foot (parking without trucks) or 18-foot (areas with truck traffic) minimum vertical clearances."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.23","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["All clearance dimensions shown on site plans near overhead utilities"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":4},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Clearance dimensions from utility poles or pole centerlines versus from outside conductors cannot be verified from available plans. Site plan does not show dimension lines extending from the outside conductor location (not pole center). On multi-conductor installations, outside conductor position may be several feet offset from pole center, making this distinction critical."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.31","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["Site features near overhead electric lines (buildings, driveways, parking areas)"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":4},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":11}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Overhead electric facilities exist on property boundaries. Site features (buildings, driveways, parking) appear to be positioned near these utilities. Registered surveyor survey data showing pole locations and mid-span clearance measurements from overhead lines to proposed site features are not provided. Vertical clearances cannot be verified without surveyed elevation data."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.37","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["ECM § 2.4.1.D","ECM § 2.4.2.C","UCM § 1.10.10.4"],"applicableAreas":["Landscape areas along southern and western property boundaries where overhead electric utilities exist"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":31},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":35}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Landscape plan (Sheet 31) shows trees within 10 feet of overhead electric lines. Trees are labeled generically as 'M' (mitigation) and 'SY' (street yard) without species identification on the landscape plan. Plant schedule (Sheet 35) lists Cedar Elm (10), Live Oak (2), Mexican Redbud (6), and Texas Mountain Laurel (2) as proposed species, but does not specify which species are planted in areas within 10 feet of overhead distribution conductors. Cedar Elm and Live Oak are not utility-compatible (mature height 40-60+ feet); Mexican Redbud and Texas Mountain Laurel are utility-compatible. Species verification for trees within 10 lateral feet of distribution conductors cannot be confirmed from available plans."}]},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2224,"cache_read_input_tokens":64903,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2224},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"97c9d1ef-3ef8-4a72-b129-cbdede465e25","uuid":"c93f1ae3-ad33-451b-91e2-462acaafc34a"}
