],"comment":"Overhead utilities confirmed on site. Section views and building elevations showing clearances from building projections (overhangs, awnings, balconies) to surveyed overhead conductors are not provided. Both 7.5-foot sky-to-ground and 15-foot radial clearances cannot be verified without these exhibits."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.7","status":"fail","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["All 8 proposed buildings on site"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Site plan set does not include building elevation sheets. Surveyed elevations and locations of overhead electric conductors are required to be shown on building elevation sheets per UCM § 1.10.3, but such sheets are not provided in the site plan."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.8","status":"fail","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["All proposed buildings and building projections"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Section views and enlarged plan detail exhibits are not provided. Code requires dimension lines showing clearances from outer electric conductor to outermost edges of buildings and building projections. No such exhibits are present in the site plan set."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.18","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.6.2"],"applicableAreas":["Internal driveways and site circulation areas"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":4},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":11}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Driveways are shown on grading plan. Overhead utilities confirmed on property boundaries. Whether driveways maintain minimum 16-foot (parking without trucks) or 18-foot (areas with truck traffic) vertical clearance from overhead lin